        _position: {x: 0, y: 0}
        _comment: 'A fixed gun (turret, emplacement, sentinel — any faction): never moves. Fires burst after burst at anything in view, fires into where a target went to ground, and otherwise sweeps the angle it was last seen at. Give its data zero patrol and chase speed.'
